										<BitOffset>0</BitOffset>
										<Value>2.000000</Value>
										<DefaultValue>2</DefaultValue>
										<Access>rw</Access>
										<Description>Specifies the range in which the actual position must lie in relation to the target position of the limit switches so that the Position Out output is activated.The tolerance is understood as a symmetrical value around the setpoint position.</Description>
