										<Entry Name="Ch A Statusword" BitLen="16" Index="#x6041" Flags="#x00002800">
											<Type>UINT</Type>
											<Comment><![CDATA[This object shall provide the status of the PDS FSA.
- Bit 0: Ready to switch on
- Bit 1: Switched on
- Bit 2: Operation enabled
- Bit 3: Fault
- Bit 4: Voltage enabled
- Bit 5: Quick stop
- Bit 6: Switch on disabled
- Bit 7: Warning
- Bit 8: reserved
- Bit 9: Remote
- Bit 10: Status toggle (see also Object 0x60D9 and 0x60DA)
- Bit 11: Internal limit active
- Bit 12: Drive follows the command value (cyclic modes of operation)
- Bit 13: Input cycle counter (see also Object 0x60D9 and 0x60DA)
- Bit 14: reserved
- Bit 15: reserved]]></Comment>
										</Entry>
										<Entry Name="Ch A Position actual value" BitLen="32" Index="#x6064" Flags="#x00002000">
											<Type>DINT</Type>
											<Comment><![CDATA[This object shall provide the actual value of the position measurement device.]]></Comment>
										</Entry>
