										<Entry Name="Ch A Controlword" BitLen="16" Index="#x6040" Flags="#x00002800">
											<Type>UINT</Type>
											<Comment><![CDATA[This object shall indicate the received command controlling the PDS FSA.
- Bit 0: Switch on
- Bit 1: Enable voltage
- Bit 2: Quick stop
- Bit 3: Enable operation
- Bit 4: reserved
- Bit 5-6: Output cycle counter (see also Object 0x60D9 and 0x60DA)
- Bit 7: Fault reset
- Bit 8: Halt
- Bit 9-15: reserved]]></Comment>
										</Entry>
